      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, por un camino del bosque, iba el sabio Durvasa.",
          "en": "One day, along a forest path, walked the sage Durvasa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Durvasa era famoso por dos cosas: su enorme poder espiritual… y su terrible mal genio.",
          "en": "Durvasa was famous for two things: his enormous spiritual power… and his terrible temper."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llevaba una guirnalda de flores del cielo, tan fragantes que todo el bosque olía a ellas.",
          "en": "He was carrying a garland of heavenly flowers, so fragrant that the whole forest smelled of them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y entonces vio venir a Indra, montado en su elefante.",
          "en": "And then he saw Indra coming, riding his elephant."
        }
