          1.12
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Durvasa ardió de furia. —¡Desprecias mi regalo! —gritó—. ¡Desprecias la gracia que te traje!",
          "en": "Durvasa burned with fury. \"You scorn my gift!\" he shouted. \"You scorn the blessing I brought you!\""
        },
        {
          "es": "—Entonces, que tu reino pierda su fortuna. Que los tres mundos pierdan su brillo.",
          "en": "\"Then may your kingdom lose its fortune. May the three worlds lose their glow.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Indra bajó del elefante de un salto y le pidió perdón.",
          "en": "Indra jumped down from the elephant and begged for forgiveness."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Durvasa dio media vuelta: —Yo no perdono. —Y se fue.",
          "en": "But Durvasa turned away. \"I do not forgive.\" And he left."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú qué piensas: el castigo fue justo, o Durvasa exageró?",
          "en": "What do you think: was the punishment fair, or did Durvasa go too far?"
        }
      ],
